These files translate algorithms of the Go standard library and of
golang.org/x/text and golang.org/x/crypto into Rust so that results are
byte-identical: the DEFLATE encoder and decoder with zlib and gzip framing,
the PNG reader and writer, the baseline/progressive JPEG decoder and baseline
encoder, decimal and floating-point parsing and formatting (including the
table of powers of ten), quoting of strings, mathematical functions, the
seeded pseudo-random source and its tables, path cleaning, JSON and XML
tokenizers and printers, URL and media-type parsing, RFC 3339 times, sorting,
certificate DER checks and the multi-byte character-set decoders. Modified:
translated to Rust, error values adapted.

